WEBVTT

00:00:32.650 --> 00:00:35.850
O great messenger that sways along the border of Hell.

00:00:35.850 --> 00:00:38.670
O spirit whose name is darker than darkness itself.

00:00:39.260 --> 00:00:42.530
Together with your rightful and teeming grudges,

00:00:42.530 --> 00:00:45.700
arise!

00:00:52.760 --> 00:00:54.490
It looks like he's rising. {lit: it looks like he's rising}

00:00:55.660 --> 00:00:58.420
Now that bothersome warrior priestess will no longer be a problem.

00:00:59.270 --> 00:01:02.730
Indeed, her fate has come to a standstill. It is inevitable.

00:01:23.330 --> 00:01:24.900
It's only a bit further.

00:01:28.200 --> 00:01:29.210
My...

00:01:29.780 --> 00:01:30.630
and...

00:01:31.340 --> 00:01:33.220
Shizuka-san's homeland,

00:01:35.050 --> 00:01:36.070
Hinomoto.

00:01:36.990 --> 00:01:39.690
We searched the entire continent, yet we didn't find her.

00:01:40.240 --> 00:01:42.780
The only place left now is this nation, huh?

00:01:43.780 --> 00:01:45.160
Let us have hope.

00:01:46.520 --> 00:01:48.070
I know that,

00:01:48.070 --> 00:01:50.490
but I've lived while things have died,

00:01:51.020 --> 00:01:54.030
and I've lost things more important than life itself,

00:01:54.030 --> 00:01:57.540
the little, short-lived hope I did have was stolen by a fallen angel.

00:01:58.320 --> 00:02:00.150
I couldn't care less about hope at this point.

00:02:00.720 --> 00:02:04.000
Then why are you accompanying me to Hinomoto?

00:02:04.430 --> 00:02:05.590
No real reason.

00:02:05.590 --> 00:02:08.310
It's not like I followed you because I believed you.

00:02:11.430 --> 00:02:12.840
In Hinomoto...

00:02:14.010 --> 00:02:16.540
the cherry blossoms should have already started blooming.

00:02:18.130 --> 00:02:19.690
I'd like to hurry and see the cherry blossoms.

00:02:20.390 --> 00:02:21.160
Cherry blossoms?

00:02:28.450 --> 00:02:30.780
Beautiful with an intense color,

00:02:30.780 --> 00:02:32.360
but fleeting as well.

00:02:33.280 --> 00:02:36.920
They're my absolute favorite flowers from Hinomoto.

00:02:38.020 --> 00:02:42.130
The cherry blossoms at the capital are particularly wonderful.

00:02:43.990 --> 00:02:45.170
I couldn't care less for flowers.

00:02:52.310 --> 00:02:54.920
Once you see the capital's cherry blossoms in full bloom,

00:02:54.920 --> 00:02:58.360
I'm sure they'll cheer you up.

00:03:13.660 --> 00:03:14.370
Huh?

00:03:34.790 --> 00:03:36.150
The Kouma Ninjas!

00:03:36.150 --> 00:03:39.280
I-I thought Shizuka-san defeated you!

00:03:39.710 --> 00:03:43.940
I'm the younger twin brother of the person you killed.

00:03:44.540 --> 00:03:47.020
The anguish of a disappearing clan...

00:03:47.420 --> 00:03:48.400
and...

00:03:48.990 --> 00:03:51.590
the grudge of us, the surviving members,

00:04:00.120 --> 00:04:01.340
you shall know them both! {tl note: know, but it's more like an angry forceful way.}

00:04:07.090 --> 00:04:08.290
Kouma Ninja Arts.

00:04:10.000 --> 00:04:11.480
Demonic Corruption!

00:04:14.580 --> 00:04:18.010
Even I would consider their wicked ways foolish!

00:05:05.040 --> 00:05:07.860
There's something I want to ask the warrior priestess.

00:05:07.860 --> 00:05:09.030
Don't interrupt.

00:05:15.570 --> 00:05:20.250
Unfortunately for you, I know that you've come back with the former Queen, Aldra.

00:05:21.120 --> 00:05:22.420
Where's Aldra?

00:05:25.450 --> 00:05:28.000
What do you want with me?

00:05:29.160 --> 00:05:31.570
S-So you're Aldra, huh?

00:05:31.890 --> 00:05:34.220
I heard that your appearance had changed considerably, but...

00:05:34.870 --> 00:05:35.440
No matter.

00:05:36.500 --> 00:05:38.640
Will you come with us?

00:05:50.560 --> 00:05:52.320
Aldra-san.

00:06:06.010 --> 00:06:07.830
Warrior Priestess Secret Move!

00:06:08.580 --> 00:06:09.940
Splitting Slash! {Checked -Danretsuzan}

00:06:42.930 --> 00:06:45.580
Aldra-san, you're safe.

00:06:45.580 --> 00:06:46.310
Yeah.

00:06:47.410 --> 00:06:48.500
I'm glad.

00:06:49.120 --> 00:06:52.010
But why are the Kouma Ninjas after you, Aldra-san?

00:06:52.010 --> 00:06:54.860
No one likes me wherever I go.

00:06:54.860 --> 00:06:56.430
That's not true.

00:06:56.860 --> 00:07:03.070
Melpha-san said that as Queen, you'll meet your citizens,

00:07:03.070 --> 00:07:05.270
and they'll learn of your wonderful, inner self.

00:07:07.230 --> 00:07:10.760
Politic power means nothing to me.

00:07:10.760 --> 00:07:14.160
I only became Queen to find my younger sister.

00:07:14.770 --> 00:07:18.810
We've come all the way to Hinomoto for that very purpose,

00:07:18.810 --> 00:07:20.030
so let us have hope.

00:07:20.260 --> 00:07:22.310
I'm tired of hearing you say that.

00:07:23.410 --> 00:07:26.220
And so, is the capital of Hinomoto?

00:07:26.220 --> 00:07:27.080
No.

00:07:27.080 --> 00:07:29.980
The water has carried us a considerable distance to the west.

00:07:31.300 --> 00:07:32.020
Oh my.

00:07:33.910 --> 00:07:36.420
The two of you are warrior priestesses, right?

00:07:36.420 --> 00:07:37.420
Oh, yes.

00:07:37.810 --> 00:07:43.020
My, to think that the grand warrior priestesses who protect Hinomoto would come all the way out here.

00:07:44.360 --> 00:07:46.480
We are not worthy of your presence.

00:07:47.140 --> 00:07:50.350
From what I can see, you seem to be rather troubled.

00:07:50.760 --> 00:07:53.110
Let this old lady take care of you.

00:07:56.530 --> 00:07:58.500
Oh, how awful.

00:07:58.500 --> 00:08:03.610
To think you've lost your belongings and even the money you'd need to pay for a single night's lodging.

00:08:03.980 --> 00:08:05.930
I can't standby and do nothing.

00:08:05.930 --> 00:08:09.040
You don't need to worry about payment for staying here.

00:08:09.340 --> 00:08:16.710
But in exchange, I'd like the two of you to help out a little bit around the inn.

00:08:16.710 --> 00:08:19.690
We lack staff, so we've been having a difficult time.

00:08:19.690 --> 00:08:21.970
Is that all right with you?

00:08:31.010 --> 00:08:33.730
It's fortunate that she was a kind person, don't you think?

00:08:36.130 --> 00:08:39.320
For the time being, I'm glad that we've found an inn to stay at.

00:08:39.920 --> 00:08:44.240
I used to depend on Shizuka-san to take care of these types of things for me.

00:08:44.800 --> 00:08:48.750
If I recall, Shizuka was former head of the Kouma Ninjas, right?

00:08:48.750 --> 00:08:49.640
Yes.

00:08:50.660 --> 00:08:55.960
A warrior priestess who serves the Emperor and a Kouma Ninja chief who opposes the Emperor.

00:08:57.430 --> 00:09:02.640
Shizuka-san and I met through a fight ordained by a sad fate.

00:09:06.960 --> 00:09:09.310
The name's Shizuka. Nice to meet you.

00:09:09.700 --> 00:09:12.600
You're the Kouma Ninja chief from...

00:09:14.060 --> 00:09:15.270
Oh, you know who I am.

00:09:16.690 --> 00:09:18.060
I gotta do this.

00:09:18.260 --> 00:09:21.530
No one's survived after being targeted by the Kouma Ninjas.

00:09:25.950 --> 00:09:28.200
Why have you started such a pointless fight?

00:09:29.860 --> 00:09:32.530
I bear responsibility for the Kouma Ninjas.

00:09:32.990 --> 00:09:36.380
I'm not allowed to lose!

00:09:45.550 --> 00:09:47.140
Why won't you finish me off?

00:09:47.890 --> 00:09:49.020
You toss yourself aside, {alt: You put yourself aside}

00:09:49.480 --> 00:09:51.400
and you fight, bearing responsibility for something.

00:09:52.070 --> 00:09:55.900
Even though you are my enemy, I can understand the reason behind your strong will.

00:10:02.770 --> 00:10:04.000
Well, that settles it.

00:10:04.000 --> 00:10:05.330
I'm going to follow you.

00:10:05.590 --> 00:10:06.130
Huh?

00:10:06.920 --> 00:10:11.240
My will just belongs to that of an insignificant chief.

00:10:11.740 --> 00:10:13.320
It's completely different than yours.

00:10:13.980 --> 00:10:14.760
I lose.

00:10:15.380 --> 00:10:16.250
It's my utter defeat.

00:10:17.110 --> 00:10:20.760
Now, with my own eyes, I want to see what you're bearing responsibility for.

00:10:21.890 --> 00:10:23.460
Shizuka-san.

00:10:24.470 --> 00:10:28.710
At some point, you became an irreplaceable person to me.

00:10:32.640 --> 00:10:33.480
Tomoe.

00:10:35.790 --> 00:10:36.950
I'm jealous.

00:10:37.950 --> 00:10:40.810
But as for me, I just had that fallen angel.

00:10:48.460 --> 00:10:50.530
All right, get to work.

00:10:50.530 --> 00:10:52.990
Stop lazing around. Time to change!

00:10:52.990 --> 00:10:54.000
Y-Yes.

00:11:00.150 --> 00:11:01.840
What are these clothes?

00:11:02.270 --> 00:11:05.180
I'm not sure. I suppose they're our uniforms.

00:11:08.150 --> 00:11:11.010
Excuse me, but what should we do?

00:11:12.370 --> 00:11:16.130
All you have to do is sit and pour alcohol for the customers.

00:11:25.330 --> 00:11:26.690
Excuse me.

00:11:28.080 --> 00:11:31.250
My name is Tomoe, and I have been sent to pour your alcohol.

00:11:32.080 --> 00:11:36.310
I am not experienced and may make mistakes,

00:11:36.310 --> 00:11:37.670
but I hope to please you.

00:11:37.670 --> 00:11:40.150
Enough with the formalities.

00:11:40.150 --> 00:11:42.590
Come here. Sit next to me.

00:11:43.830 --> 00:11:45.510
You go this way.

00:11:46.070 --> 00:11:49.060
This customer has somewhat of a fetish,

00:11:49.390 --> 00:11:51.800
but just do what he says, okay?

00:11:52.640 --> 00:11:53.430
Okay.

00:12:07.090 --> 00:12:09.670
Your body is certainly attractive to men.

00:12:10.840 --> 00:12:11.860
What are you doing!?

00:12:12.260 --> 00:12:13.240
How shameful!

00:12:16.310 --> 00:12:18.480
Come on, fight back! Fight back!

00:12:18.480 --> 00:12:19.610
Take this!

00:12:21.660 --> 00:12:24.050
You don't know when to give up, girl.

00:12:24.050 --> 00:12:26.150
Or are you perhaps a virgin?

00:12:27.390 --> 00:12:29.340
Oh, I'm quite lucky.

00:12:38.490 --> 00:12:39.590
Don't fight back!

00:12:39.940 --> 00:12:41.730
How could you do something like this?

00:12:41.730 --> 00:12:43.500
What are you talking about?

00:12:43.500 --> 00:12:45.610
Isn't this why you came here?

00:12:48.710 --> 00:12:51.200
So then being the customer's partner meant being...

00:12:58.070 --> 00:13:00.050
Are you from a foreign country?

00:13:00.050 --> 00:13:03.000
You look exactly like a Western doll.

00:13:15.880 --> 00:13:17.950
How is it? What do you think?

00:13:24.030 --> 00:13:24.840
Tomoe.

00:13:25.970 --> 00:13:26.740
They ran away!

00:13:26.370 --> 00:13:27.130
I'm very sorry!

00:13:27.130 --> 00:13:28.500
This is a disaster!

00:13:28.500 --> 00:13:29.640
They're not over here.

00:13:29.640 --> 00:13:30.760
The back! Go around back!

00:13:30.760 --> 00:13:31.660
Did you see them?

00:13:32.350 --> 00:13:33.760
I'm truly sorry.

00:13:34.410 --> 00:13:36.440
Because I was so careless,

00:13:36.900 --> 00:13:39.180
we ended up coming to such a filthy place.

00:13:39.890 --> 00:13:41.030
Don't worry about it.

00:13:41.900 --> 00:13:43.550
It was an interesting turn of events.

00:13:57.660 --> 00:13:59.640
This is called a sweet dumpling.

00:13:59.640 --> 00:14:01.380
One of Hinomoto's pastries, huh? {alt: for pastries - snacks}

00:14:01.380 --> 00:14:02.620
It doesn't taste half-bad.

00:14:04.010 --> 00:14:05.690
You have some on your mouth.

00:14:18.660 --> 00:14:20.070
Not feeling well?

00:14:20.710 --> 00:14:21.280
No.

00:14:22.090 --> 00:14:24.130
Everything before my eyes went dark for a moment. {alt: My field of vision went dark for a moment.}

00:14:24.730 --> 00:14:26.850
I might be a little tired.

00:14:27.790 --> 00:14:29.500
How surprising.

00:14:29.500 --> 00:14:32.570
Even the warrior priestess Tomoe can get tired?

00:14:32.570 --> 00:14:34.310
Of course I can.

00:14:34.310 --> 00:14:36.960
Don't talk about me like I'm some strange creature.

00:15:25.340 --> 00:15:26.570
I'm very sorry.

00:15:27.440 --> 00:15:30.230
I thought a foreigner would stand out, but...

00:15:30.980 --> 00:15:33.960
I hope, but my efforts are in vain.

00:15:33.960 --> 00:15:35.380
It's always been this way.

00:15:35.380 --> 00:15:38.300
If I have to keep feeling this way over and over, then there's no point in living.

00:15:38.500 --> 00:15:41.040
Aldra-san, you must not become discouraged.

00:15:41.430 --> 00:15:43.400
You have to have hope.

00:15:43.400 --> 00:15:46.050
I'll personally ask the Emperor for help.

00:15:46.050 --> 00:15:46.680
We'll find her for su—

00:15:46.680 --> 00:15:47.630
I've had enough!

00:15:49.030 --> 00:15:51.820
You've already had a friend with whom you shared trust.

00:15:51.820 --> 00:15:54.230
You could never understand my feelings!

00:15:55.720 --> 00:15:56.670
Aldra-san.

00:16:08.350 --> 00:16:10.900
You're finally away from each other.

00:16:11.430 --> 00:16:13.390
Will you come with us?

00:16:14.190 --> 00:16:15.450
Oh, you?

00:16:17.460 --> 00:16:19.080
Do whatever you want.

00:16:19.390 --> 00:16:21.280
My hope has already died out.

00:16:23.260 --> 00:16:24.820
Aldra-san.

00:16:25.200 --> 00:16:26.770
Where are you?

00:16:27.080 --> 00:16:28.490
Aldra-san.

00:16:28.910 --> 00:16:30.530
Aldra-san!

00:16:32.500 --> 00:16:33.490
Those are...

00:16:34.680 --> 00:16:36.170
Aldra-san's clothes!

00:16:42.330 --> 00:16:44.210
The capital's eastern gate.

00:16:44.210 --> 00:16:46.490
Come to Kinjikyu.

00:16:47.250 --> 00:16:48.440
Kouma Ninjas.

00:16:48.730 --> 00:16:50.140
How could they!?

00:16:50.140 --> 00:16:51.190
This is unforgivable!

00:17:01.360 --> 00:17:03.070
Well done.

00:17:03.370 --> 00:17:03.900
Yes.

00:17:04.580 --> 00:17:05.740
I am at your service.

00:17:06.630 --> 00:17:08.280
Now things can proceed.

00:17:15.700 --> 00:17:16.890
What is all this?

00:17:18.480 --> 00:17:22.560
One borne from demons shall return to the demons, Aldra.

00:17:23.440 --> 00:17:27.800
But first things first, we will get rid of the meddlesome warrior priestess Tomoe.

00:17:28.200 --> 00:17:31.150
Don't speak nonsense. I didn't order you to kill Tomoe.

00:17:39.040 --> 00:17:42.420
It's been a while, my beloved Aldra.

00:17:43.450 --> 00:17:45.040
Delmora.

00:17:52.410 --> 00:17:53.670
Kinjikyu.

00:17:54.620 --> 00:17:55.960
A remnant of the past.

00:17:55.960 --> 00:18:01.420
A Shinto priest, who lost his mind, planned to summon demons from the underworld.

00:18:01.420 --> 00:18:05.550
The Emperor at the time shut down this shrine, making it taboo.

00:18:07.050 --> 00:18:09.650
Why are we meeting at such an ominous place?

00:18:14.240 --> 00:18:15.610
I am the warrior priestess Tomoe.

00:18:15.840 --> 00:18:18.870
I have been summoned here, and I now present myself.

00:18:35.630 --> 00:18:36.910
I applaud you for coming here,

00:18:37.450 --> 00:18:39.040
warrior priestess Tomoe.

00:18:39.300 --> 00:18:41.370
Where is Aldra-san?

00:18:41.370 --> 00:18:42.880
If any harm has come to her...

00:18:44.020 --> 00:18:46.720
We wouldn't even so much as scratch our important guest.

00:18:47.850 --> 00:18:48.980
Important guest?

00:18:49.860 --> 00:18:52.560
Hinomoto is heading towards a new age.

00:18:53.010 --> 00:18:58.890
The cabinet ministers think that the Emperor can no longer govern Hinomoto.

00:18:59.210 --> 00:19:02.990
And so, we move on from the Emperor to a new ruler.

00:19:03.360 --> 00:19:03.960
King?

00:19:04.800 --> 00:19:05.990
Are you the one?

00:19:06.440 --> 00:19:08.980
The one who is foolish enough to defy me?

00:19:11.760 --> 00:19:14.870
I am the Queen of Demons, Aldra.

00:19:17.500 --> 00:19:19.000
Aldra-san!

00:19:19.190 --> 00:19:21.130
Why do you look like that? Could it be...

00:19:21.390 --> 00:19:22.850
That's right.

00:19:22.850 --> 00:19:24.800
I've returned.

00:19:25.220 --> 00:19:27.500
Delmora! How could you do this!?

00:19:30.020 --> 00:19:33.570
How about we start off by batting away the fly in front of us?

00:19:34.220 --> 00:19:35.760
My beloved Aldra.

00:19:36.210 --> 00:19:37.650
Don't give me orders.

00:19:39.380 --> 00:19:40.560
You didn't need to tell me.

00:19:50.610 --> 00:19:53.660
I shall defeat{alt: kill} those who stand before me.

00:19:54.630 --> 00:19:57.500
You must not be corrupted by the demons, Aldra-san!

00:19:57.990 --> 00:19:58.880
Quiet!

00:19:58.880 --> 00:20:02.520
You could never understand how much I've suffered!

00:20:22.550 --> 00:20:26.450
Evil has stolen away her heart, but she bears no sin.

00:20:27.560 --> 00:20:28.820
However,

00:20:29.420 --> 00:20:31.370
if I am defeated here,

00:20:32.170 --> 00:20:33.250
Hinomoto would...

00:20:35.340 --> 00:20:36.360
The Emperor would...

00:20:53.170 --> 00:20:54.380
Decapitating Slash! {yeah i suck at these attack names ;___;} {Actually that is the name XD the literal is head dissociation strike}

00:20:55.900 --> 00:20:56.750
Minion! {also suck ;___;} {English XD actually - Fibi: Not "Minion"? }

00:21:12.940 --> 00:21:14.110
How unsightly.

00:21:14.630 --> 00:21:16.570
Die by Aldra's hand!

00:21:17.140 --> 00:21:18.480
And then my older brother...

00:21:18.960 --> 00:21:22.770
and the entirety of the Kouma Ninjas will be avenged!

00:21:26.080 --> 00:21:27.840
Oh yes, Aldra.

00:21:28.220 --> 00:21:29.900
It's about time you finish her off.

00:21:36.920 --> 00:21:37.670
What the?

00:21:38.250 --> 00:21:38.970
Stop!

00:21:39.540 --> 00:21:39.940
St...

00:21:49.550 --> 00:21:50.650
Are you still trying to hold on?

00:21:51.820 --> 00:21:53.620
Secret Griever!{...facepalm} {Yes facepalm XD}

00:21:58.130 --> 00:21:59.050
It's happening again.

00:22:07.530 --> 00:22:10.760
It seems that you've been cursed.

00:22:11.310 --> 00:22:12.550
How interesting.

00:22:12.550 --> 00:22:14.840
Oh, it's a curse cast by the Swamp Witch.

00:22:19.350 --> 00:22:20.660
So that's what happened back then.

00:22:38.040 --> 00:22:40.380
W-What's happening?

00:22:41.360 --> 00:22:43.800
Don't let them beat you, Tomoe-sama.

00:22:43.800 --> 00:22:44.420
Huh?

00:22:46.140 --> 00:22:47.370
Shizuka-san!

00:22:49.660 --> 00:22:50.540
Isn't that...

00:22:50.820 --> 00:22:54.220
Don't hesitate Aldra. Kill Tomoe.

00:22:55.390 --> 00:22:57.520
You have to save her.

00:22:57.520 --> 00:22:58.270
I know.

00:22:59.260 --> 00:23:00.050
I'll kill you.

00:23:02.030 --> 00:23:03.510
Believe in yourself.

00:23:04.240 --> 00:23:06.830
I have faith that you can see through her attack, Tomoe-sama.

00:23:09.170 --> 00:23:11.200
Die!

00:23:19.230 --> 00:23:20.080
Just...

00:23:20.890 --> 00:23:22.640
what am I doing?

00:23:23.680 --> 00:23:29.700
I came to this remote land with Tomoe in search of my younger sister.

00:23:30.220 --> 00:23:31.050
I came with Tomoe.

00:23:32.300 --> 00:23:33.840
Kill Tomoe?

00:23:34.350 --> 00:23:38.810
That's right Aldra. Kill Tomoe.

00:23:41.170 --> 00:23:42.260
I won't...

00:23:43.000 --> 00:23:44.080
kill Tomoe.

00:23:44.840 --> 00:23:46.900
You can't do that, Aldra.

00:23:47.350 --> 00:23:50.590
If you don't listen to what I say,

00:23:50.950 --> 00:23:55.400
wouldn't that make me sad, my beloved Aldra. {=} {changed}

00:23:59.130 --> 00:24:00.220
Hi.

00:24:00.530 --> 00:24:01.250
Let go!

00:24:02.580 --> 00:24:04.470
Tomoe-sama, now's your chance!

00:24:07.320 --> 00:24:09.670
Spirit Freezing

00:24:10.930 --> 00:24:12.380
Slashing Lunar Strike.

00:24:16.760 --> 00:24:18.420
The evil spirit disappears. {Evil spirit be gone}

00:24:47.640 --> 00:24:48.540
Aldra-san.

00:24:57.320 --> 00:24:58.270
Thank you,

00:24:58.890 --> 00:24:59.880
Shizuka-san.

00:25:00.160 --> 00:25:01.350
Not at all.

00:25:01.350 --> 00:25:03.920
All of this was your own power.

00:25:03.920 --> 00:25:04.940
Mine?

00:25:05.400 --> 00:25:08.000
I'm an illusion spawned from your heart,

00:25:08.680 --> 00:25:11.810
a heart that loves others.

00:25:13.280 --> 00:25:17.600
Tomoe-sama, no matter what harshness fate has in store {original: }for you in the future,

00:25:18.340 --> 00:25:20.370
I'm sure you'll be able to overcome anything by yourself.

00:25:21.570 --> 00:25:22.680
By myself?

00:25:23.870 --> 00:25:24.530
Yes.

00:25:26.620 --> 00:25:27.610
So,

00:25:28.350 --> 00:25:29.260
this is farewell.

00:25:29.920 --> 00:25:30.870
Tomoe-sama.

00:25:31.450 --> 00:25:32.620
Shizuka-san!

00:25:39.630 --> 00:25:40.430
Tomoe.

00:25:41.610 --> 00:25:42.920
Oh, thank goodness.

00:25:42.920 --> 00:25:44.780
You regained consciousness. {=}

00:25:45.520 --> 00:25:45.900
I...

00:25:46.640 --> 00:25:47.970
I'm sorry.

00:25:50.160 --> 00:25:50.540
O...

00:25:51.140 --> 00:25:52.100
Okay.

00:25:53.170 --> 00:25:53.950
Okay.

00:25:55.600 --> 00:25:56.220
Okay.

00:26:00.060 --> 00:26:01.170
Farewell,

00:26:01.670 --> 00:26:02.580
Shizuka-san.

00:26:14.610 --> 00:26:15.570
So these are...

00:26:16.050 --> 00:26:17.010
cherry blossoms.

00:26:17.760 --> 00:26:18.900
Do you like them?

00:26:19.510 --> 00:26:21.250
They're exactly how you described them, Tomoe.

00:26:21.560 --> 00:26:24.630
Beautiful yet intense with color.

00:26:25.580 --> 00:26:28.210
But by merely looking up at them,

00:26:28.210 --> 00:26:30.840
I feel like I'm receiving courage and hope.

00:26:31.410 --> 00:26:34.680
It was worthwhile to bring you here.

00:26:36.620 --> 00:26:37.280
So...

00:26:37.840 --> 00:26:39.290
you can't see at all anymore?

00:26:40.630 --> 00:26:43.110
Even without seeing, I can feel them.

00:26:43.110 --> 00:26:44.150
My homeland's,

00:26:44.660 --> 00:26:46.070
Hinomoto's, flowers.

00:26:47.020 --> 00:26:48.000
Tomoe.

00:26:48.790 --> 00:26:52.120
This is surely something ordained by fate.

00:26:52.830 --> 00:26:56.600
I must accept it and bear through life with strength.

00:26:58.660 --> 00:26:59.630
She said...

00:27:00.170 --> 00:27:02.080
the same thing as well.

00:27:08.870 --> 00:27:10.410
Well, let us go.

00:27:10.410 --> 00:27:11.850
The Emperor is awaiting us.
